e to support agent file extension\nL1189:   * Add `exclude_tools` field to agent file to support excluding tools\nL1190:   * Add `subagents` field to agent file to support defining subagents\nL1191: \nL1192: ## 0.22 (2025-10-09)\nL1193: \nL1194: ### Changed\nL1195: \nL1196:   * Improve `SearchWeb` and `FetchURL` tool call visualization\nL1197:   * Improve search result output format\nL1198: \nL1199: ## 0.21 (2025-10-09)\nL1200: ### Added\nL1201:   * Add `--print` option as a shortcut for `--ui print`, `--acp` option as a shortcut for `--ui acp`\nL1202:   * Support `--output-format stream-json` to print output in JSON format\nL1203:   * Add `SearchWeb` tool with `services.moonshot_search` configuration. You need to configure it with `\"services\": {\"moonshot_search\": {\"api_key\": \"your-search-api-key\"}}` in your config file.\nL1204:   * Add `FetchURL` tool\nL1205:   * Add `Think` tool\nL1206:   * Add `PatchFile` tool, not enabled in Kimi Koder agent\nL1207:   * Enable `SendDMail` and `Task` tool in Kimi Koder agent with better tool prompts\nL1208:   * Add `ENSOUL_NOW` builtin system prompt argument\nL1209: ### Changed\nL1210: \nL1211:   * Better-looking `/release-notes`\nL1212:   * Improve tool descriptions\nL1213:   * Improve tool output truncation\nL1214: \nL1215: ## 0.20 (2025-09-30)\nL1216: \nL1217: ### Added\nL1218: \nL1219:   * Add `--ui acp` option to start Agent Client Protocol (ACP) server\nL1220: \nL1221: ## 0.19 (2025-09-29)\nL1222: \nL1223: ### Added\nL1224: \nL1225:   * Support piped stdin for print UI\nL1226:   * Support `--input-format=stream-json` for piped JSON input\nL1227: \nL1228: ### Fixed\nL1229: \nL1230:   * Do not include `CHECKPOINT` messages in the context when `SendDMail` is not enabled\nL1231: \nL1232: ## 0.18 (2025-09-29)\nL1233: ### Added\nL1234: \nL1235:   * Support `max_context_size` in LLM model configurations to configure the maximum context size (in tokens)\nL1236: \nL1237: ### Improved\nL1238: \nL1239:   * Improve `ReadFile` tool description\nL1240: \nL1241: ## 0.17 (2025-09-29)\nL1242: \nL1243: ### Fixed\nL1244: \nL1245:   * Fix step count in error message when exceeded max steps\nL1246:   * Fix history file assertion error in `kimi_run`\nL1247:   * Fix error handling in print mode and single command shell mode\nL1248:   * Add retry for LLM API connection errors and timeout errors\nL1249: \nL1250: ### Changed\nL1251: \nL1252:   * Increase default max-steps-per-run to 100\nL1253: ## 0.16.0 (2025-09-26)\nL1254: \nL1255: ### Tools\nL1256: \nL1257:   * Add `SendDMail` tool (disabled in Kimi Koder, can be enabled in custom agent)\nL1258: \nL1259: ### SDK\nL1260: \nL1261:   * Session history file can be specified via `_history_file` parameter when creating a new session\nL1262: \nL1263: ## 0.15.0 (2025-09-26)\nL1264: \nL1265:   * Improve tool robustness\nL1266: \nL1267: ## 0.14.0 (2025-09-25)\nL1268: \nL1269: ### Added\nL1270: \nL1271:   * Add `StrReplaceFile` tool\nL1272: \nL1273: ### Improved\nL1274: \nL1275:   * Emphasize the use of the same language as the user\nL1276: \nL1277: ## 0.13.0 (2025-09-25)\nL1278: ### Added\nL1279: \nL1280:   * Add `SetTodoList` tool\nL1281:   * Add `User-Agent` in LLM API calls\nL1282: \nL1283: ### Improved\nL1284: \nL1285:   * Better system prompt and tool description\nL1286:   * Better error messages for LLM\nL1287: \nL1288: ## 0.12.0 (2025-09-24)\nL1289: \nL1290: ### Added\nL1291: \nL1292:   * Add `print` UI mode, which can be used via `--ui print` option\nL1293:   * Add logging and `--debug` option\nL1294: \nL1295: ### Changed\nL1296: \nL1297:   * Catch EOF error for better experience\nL1298: \nL1299: ## 0.11.1 (2025-09-22)\nL1300: \nL1301: ### Changed\nL1302: \nL1303:   * Rename `max_retry_per_step` to `max_retries_per_step`\nL1304: \nL1305: ## 0.11.0 (2025-09-22)\nL1306: ### Added\nL1307: \nL1308:   * Add `/release-notes` command\nL1309:   * Add retry for LLM API errors\nL1310:   * Add loop control configuration, e.g. `{\"loop_control\": {\"max_steps_per